# Token Discipline

- Read only files that are directly relevant to the current task.
- Do not scan the entire repo unless absolutely necessary.
- Prefer targeted search by feature name, route name, component name, or file path.
- Summarize large files instead of pasting them.
- Do not duplicate long PRD content in responses.
- Work in phases.
- Stop after producing a plan unless explicitly asked to implement.
- When implementing, change only the files listed in the approved plan.